{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5c27f95fddcb00a14513c92844a95b7aefefdd03395f1a939fbf9a0ac3d0ce4b", "ja": "エントランスの準備もよし、と。\n環の初公演まで、あと少しか……。", "zh": "大厅的准备也完成了。\n环的首次公演就快开始了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "102554a41bc4f79b88ba15f5b18f038d983b1db4ecd78ec944a6bc1ae7e5cb8d", "ja": "おやぶ～ん！", "zh": "老大～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7b2351fe737ca21a39c2e6449bb5d9d6b1c33e98b114f0fdd18dbf4e6d4cbefb", "ja": "この声は……環か？", "zh": "这个声音是……环吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "71121b3b63891490d9bf78b4ba53d68c362d3a9d821e18b246c13e946366457c", "ja": "みてみて、おやぶん！\nこれ、着てみた！！", "zh": "你看你看，老大！\n环换好衣服了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "37da803c6700e6d0e0234a4882bbda556c790c5b68c77e572f69af76b28644d6", "ja": "うん。今日もよく似合ってるぞ、環！", "zh": "嗯，今天的服装你穿起来也很好看哦，环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "d63813d446a33cf32eafd0b3131cab99161ae7eb94676e939418e35a066da252", "ja": "ほんと！？　くふふ…♪", "zh": "真的吗！？呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "ca0d4f3f89c988d01b64c99406e13ae3b786e9ef14942b7f2dc87dec898b532e", "ja": "たまき、おやぶんに一番に見せようと思って、\n着替えてすぐ走ってきたんだ！", "zh": "环想要让老大最先看到，\n所以一换好就马上跑来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3bccdbd134eba4c98f2dd875cebb42e4f009703081560000fdedadcda9565c79", "ja": "はは、そうか。\nでも廊下は走っちゃダメだぞ、危ないからな？", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。\n可是走廊上不能奔跑哦，很危险的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "1701795974a5647754668ab54b1e633538a906815675d03bdb4bc8a800a59cf9", "ja": "はーいっ！　あのね、おやぶん。\nアイドルってすごいね！", "zh": "好──！老大，环跟你说，\n当偶像真的很棒耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "39bff113291b092748abc1131ee6bec57ea4fc3683020c3f19c9ee8d606ffe3f", "ja": "いっぱい歌ったり踊ったりできるし、\nカワイイ服着られるし……たまき、知らなかったぞ～！", "zh": "可以一直唱歌跳舞，\n还能穿可爱的衣服……环以前都不知道～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bf9ac3447335066aa31c3249de0de2f3c3d1e6f0b1dc62354a857f5c4b83c546", "ja": "はは、そうか。本番は、きっともっと楽しいぞ！\nステージの上から見る景色を、環も気に入るはずだ。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。不过正式上场时会更开心喔！\n环，你一定也会喜欢在舞台上看见的景色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "192a825a2e4008da874f30e80dee2e3c22bd17e8b546f0339ae4d37c31c62bc4", "ja": "そっか～。\n楽しみだな～、くふふ♪", "zh": "真的吗～\n好期待～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0f2a7f04c2033d438c768c2915997127dabc6f23133c9f36df0641e036f6e274", "ja": "とはいえ、まだ本番前だからな。\n衣装が汚れるといけないから、そろそろ着替えて……。", "zh": "话虽如此，公演还没正式开始，\n不能弄脏服装，差不多该换回去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "9b5ab634e79b17dd14769d2ca263eb68867efd8bfd80c499cc81f12f60042050", "ja": "ねえねえ、おやぶん！\nおやぶんに、お返しのプレゼント！", "zh": "欸欸，老大！\n环要送老大回礼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "3bfe4f2b757b944da689f91eedf282fdfcba85ae2917a471790b72430bb6e7e0", "ja": "目をつぶって、手を広げて？", "zh": "闭上眼睛，手掌打开！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "57fb62093e4099f1c547f35efb5544788aaf00d9577743425bac6a5004aeaa85", "ja": "え？　お返しって……。", "zh": "呃？什么回礼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "87210db1b4481ba7d38925e24884f8169e344626dc0860807819261d7e1eb8ed", "ja": "はやく！", "zh": "快点啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bb54bb54d1f8cd46ab1c2dc53df2632422a9724a651a6296fbfa652220d6c2a1", "ja": "（環からプレゼント？\nいったい、なんだろう……？）", "zh": "（环要送我礼物？\n到底会是什么呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1018_se", "source_sha256": "89e144344e1bd6f70471a0ff6188e68217955ea416e42a03092a3aa37cff1d28", "ja": "カサカサ……", "zh": "窸窸窣窣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1019_p", "source_sha256": "28cbcf2428b1c0daca375aac004a4293be3a617e11c903b553457c6ff16e8ba1", "ja": "んっ？\n何か、動いてる……？", "zh": "嗯？\n好像有东西在动……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "9a218156a433bea0d23f2a0e0b7f93ed7bc3166b12a164d4dc6bbd2496e0e216", "ja": "…… はい！\n目開けて、見ていいよ！", "zh": "……好了！\n可以睁开眼睛看啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1021_p", "source_sha256": "06b0d9a7f4bea6eb61b550ea3d2da8777ff8ddb414052a3347d1f98d1fc57f02", "ja": "ど、どれどれ……\nうわっ、バッタじゃないか！？", "zh": "我、我看看……\n哇！这不是蝗虫吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "19627cdfeee4fc07bafedd06a5871299580329499783d0bc53dca545ca46ff7b", "ja": "違うよ、おやぶん。\n普通のバッタじゃなくて、殿様バッタだよ。", "zh": "不是啦，老大。\n这不是普通的蝗虫，是飞蝗哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "11cd83e21923225172db221b6e23c2bca544d1a359a895d259bf71f0948e273c", "ja": "今日、劇場に来る途中の道で、つかまえたんだ。\n宝物にしようと思ったけど、おやぶんにあげるね！", "zh": "是今天环过来剧场的半路上抓到的。\n本来想留着当宝贝收藏，但现在决定送给老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1024_p", "source_sha256": "8e7c6a62c83d922a93df32724f255ff170eb4b766b512582985d48977c119928", "ja": "そ、そうか、ありがとうな。\n大事に飼うよ……あっ！？", "zh": "这、这样啊，谢谢你。\n我会用心饲养……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1025_se", "source_sha256": "cd87757341b587d45eec97159c456f750a6bf885fb9e76ece7ed7e566ea55431", "ja": "バタタタタッ", "zh": "啪哒哒哒哒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1026_p", "source_sha256": "c32327ed8ba8e81fb31fe284a9be7c336152e528b05fd1988cfc52ec7d9faf13", "ja": "し、しまった。\nバッタが逃げた……。", "zh": "糟、糟糕。\n牠逃走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "bd6f6ba837e72161dfca24a444769c92e44db42abc5b70d41b4eda138b36d2f1", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、おやぶん！\nたまきがもう1回、つかまえてあげる！", "zh": "放心吧，老大！\n环再去把牠抓回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "96de5d444f021767a90bab1df818d290965c1f16d5d74e106a7be7315424ee77", "ja": "バッタ、待てー！", "zh": "等等啊，蝗虫～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c128bd6ff275fb444c1eae6281edc3df9fed256dbf90f2e665267b66882b4f52", "ja": "た、環！\nそんなに走ったら、衣装が……んっ？", "zh": "环、环！\n你跑步动作这么大，服装会……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1030_p", "source_sha256": "2f27985c9404c3f102ce8b79ec10906bf6c1cb9c095e2b51103a6f1610c2887e", "ja": "（環、バッタに夢中なのかと思ったら……\nちゃんと衣装を汚さないように気をつけてるのか）", "zh": "（我还以为环一心只想着追逐蝗虫……\n原来她真的有在注意不弄脏服装。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1031_040tam", "source_sha256": "bf10855576cd985f1ced4b0dd70d682c1fdfc15b276baae5a8146a70cec998ae", "ja": "うう、手がとどかない……\nおやぶん、肩車して！", "zh": "呜呜，手构不到……\n老大，把我扛起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1032_p", "source_sha256": "516043be773a12de9630ee17ba7661d673c82f381cc68783acbf7b627615cf10", "ja": "よ、よし、わかった！\nちょっと待ってろ！", "zh": "好、好，我知道了！\n等我一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1033_p", "source_sha256": "0f84c8a71905247180894061014beb6418cc3d3d2ba3e84591f526038432568e", "ja": "（言葉で言わなくても、大切なことは伝わってる。\n今の環に一番必要なのは、いろいろな経験なのかもな）", "zh": "（就算没说出来，她也知道什么很重要。\n现在的环最需要的，或许是多多累积各种经验吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_040tam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_040tam_003_1034_p", "source_sha256": "595c117a58f490493241443667e2295c9897750da8156d7fce6aa1717c30d4bf", "ja": "（本番のステージに立った環を見るのが、楽しみだ。\nきっと何もかもが、いい経験になるだろう……！）", "zh": "（真期待环站上正式舞台。\n到时的一切肯定都会成为很棒的养分……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
